## Question A: Explain how to containerize Selenium test scripts and dependencies using Docker.

### Aim

To create separate Docker containers for the web application, Selenium browser, and Selenium test runner.

### Architecture

```text
                 Docker Network
                       |
       ---------------------------------
       |               |               |
  Web App         Selenium        Test Runner
  Container       Container       Container
  Nginx            Chrome          Python
  Port 80          Port 4444       Selenium
