**[VS Code – create a file named `Dockerfile.app`]**

```dockerfile
# Use Nginx as the web server
FROM nginx:alpine

# Copy the registration page into the web server
COPY EventRegistrationForm.html /usr/share/nginx/html/index.html

# Expose the web server port
